{"vid":"OsQzZtj9BtE","source":"OsQzZtj9BtE.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.9,"txt":"[NARRATOR] We are living in a time of profound change,"},{"t":3.9,"txt":"from technological breakthroughs to"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"geopolitical shifts, from economic volatility"},{"t":9,"txt":"to environmental strain."},{"t":11.1,"txt":"It's in moments like this that leadership"},{"t":13.4,"txt":"matters more than ever."},{"t":16.2,"txt":"Being an effective leader today requires a deep understanding of"},{"t":20,"txt":"the forces shaping our future."},{"t":23,"txt":"That's why we are launching the Stanford Leadership Institute,"},{"t":27,"txt":"designed to prepare leaders"},{"t":28.8,"txt":"not only to navigate these forces,"},{"t":31.4,"txt":"but also to shape them."},{"t":33.8,"txt":"The Stanford Leadership Institute is"},{"t":36,"txt":"an interdisciplinary hub for innovative research,"},{"t":39.1,"txt":"teaching, and convenings."},{"t":41.5,"txt":"It explores key areas of innovation and change"},{"t":44.6,"txt":"impacting leaders today: science and technology,"},{"t":48.4,"txt":"environmental resources, governance, markets,"},{"t":52.4,"txt":"governmental policy, and other societal forces."},{"t":56.5,"txt":"By bringing these perspectives together, the Institute offers"},{"t":60.2,"txt":"new insights to empower leaders to thrive in our"},{"t":63.2,"txt":"rapidly changing world."},{"t":66.9,"txt":"Based at the Stanford Graduate School of Business,"},{"t":69.4,"txt":"the Institute extends the school's leadership knowledge"},{"t":72.7,"txt":"to broader audiences."},{"t":74.6,"txt":"It infuses the GSB with fresh insights from"},{"t":77.6,"txt":"Stanford, Silicon Valley, and beyond to address the most"},{"t":81.4,"txt":"critical challenges of our time."},{"t":84.4,"txt":"Stanford University has always been a place for leadership."},{"t":88,"txt":"Our vision is clear: to inspire leaders to think"},{"t":91.4,"txt":"broadly, act boldly, and lead proactively."},{"t":96.3,"txt":"This is an invitation to join us on this journey as we prepare"},{"t":100.5,"txt":"leaders who understand the world as it is and what it's becoming."}],"words":[{"t":0.88,"w":"[NARRATOR]"},{"t":0.88,"w":"We"},{"t":0.88,"w":"are"},{"t":0.88,"w":"living"},{"t":0.88,"w":"in"},{"t":0.88,"w":"a"},{"t":0.88,"w":"time"},{"t":0.88,"w":"of"},{"t":0.88,"w":"profound"},{"t":0.88,"w":"change,"},{"t":3.86,"w":"from"},{"t":3.86,"w":"technological"},{"t":3.86,"w":"breakthroughs"},{"t":3.86,"w":"to"},{"t":5.76,"w":"geopolitical"},{"t":5.76,"w":"shifts,"},{"t":5.76,"w":"from"},{"t":5.76,"w":"economic"},{"t":5.76,"w":"volatility"},{"t":9.04,"w":"to"},{"t":9.04,"w":"environmental"},{"t":9.04,"w":"strain."},{"t":11.12,"w":"It's"},{"t":11.12,"w":"in"},{"t":11.12,"w":"moments"},{"t":11.12,"w":"like"},{"t":11.12,"w":"this"},{"t":11.12,"w":"that"},{"t":11.12,"w":"leadership"},{"t":13.44,"w":"matters"},{"t":13.44,"w":"more"},{"t":13.44,"w":"than"},{"t":13.44,"w":"ever."},{"t":16.18,"w":"Being"},{"t":16.18,"w":"an"},{"t":16.18,"w":"effective"},{"t":16.18,"w":"leader"},{"t":16.18,"w":"today"},{"t":16.18,"w":"requires"},{"t":16.18,"w":"a"},{"t":16.18,"w":"deep"},{"t":16.18,"w":"understanding"},{"t":16.18,"w":"of"},{"t":19.98,"w":"the"},{"t":19.98,"w":"forces"},{"t":19.98,"w":"shaping"},{"t":19.98,"w":"our"},{"t":19.98,"w":"future."},{"t":23.04,"w":"That's"},{"t":23.04,"w":"why"},{"t":23.04,"w":"we"},{"t":23.04,"w":"are"},{"t":23.04,"w":"launching"},{"t":23.04,"w":"the"},{"t":23.04,"w":"Stanford"},{"t":23.04,"w":"Leadership"},{"t":23.04,"w":"Institute,"},{"t":26.96,"w":"designed"},{"t":26.96,"w":"to"},{"t":26.96,"w":"prepare"},{"t":26.96,"w":"leaders"},{"t":28.75,"w":"not"},{"t":28.75,"w":"only"},{"t":28.75,"w":"to"},{"t":28.75,"w":"navigate"},{"t":28.75,"w":"these"},{"t":28.75,"w":"forces,"},{"t":31.35,"w":"but"},{"t":31.35,"w":"also"},{"t":31.35,"w":"to"},{"t":31.35,"w":"shape"},{"t":31.35,"w":"them."},{"t":33.8,"w":"The"},{"t":33.8,"w":"Stanford"},{"t":33.8,"w":"Leadership"},{"t":33.8,"w":"Institute"}